{{arrow-footer animationsEnabled=animationsEnabled confirmButtonDisabled=confirmButtonDisabled confirmButtonText=confirmButtonText confirmButtonShowTooltip=confirmButtonShowTooltip confirmButtonTooltipText=confirmButtonTooltipText confirmButtonHoverSound=buttonSounds.confirmHover confirmButtonClickSound=buttonSounds.confirmClick closeButtonDisabled=closeButtonDisabled closeButtonText=closeButtonText closeButtonHoverSound=buttonSounds.closeHover closeButtonClickSound=buttonSounds.closeClick closeButtonType="close" confirmButtonClicked="confirmButton" closeButtonClicked="closeButton"}}
<span data-eligibility-observer="{{eligibilityObserver}}">
</>
<span data-showing-party-observer="{{showingPartyObserver}}">
</>
<span data-search-error-penalized-summoner-id-observer="{{searchErrorPenalizedSummonerIdObserver}}">
</>
<span data-close-transition-observer="{{handleCloseDuringTransition}}">
</>
<div style="display:none;">
  <lol-uikit-content-block class="custom-games-error" id="custom-games-disabled-reasons" type="dialog-medium">
    {{#if showCustomGameContentWarning}}
      <ul>
        <li>
          {{tra.custom_game_training_content_warning}}
        </>
        <li>
          {{tra.custom_game_training_rewards_warning}}
        </>
        <br>
        </>
        <p>
          {{tra.custom_game_training_question}}
        </>
      </>
    {{else}}
      <h5 class="preserve-case">
        {{tra.custom_game_rewards_disabled_header}}
      </>
      <p>
        {{tra.custom_game_rewards_disabled_question}}
      </>
      <p>
        {{tra.custom_game_rewards_disabled_reasons_header}}
      </>
      <ul>
        {{#each customGameRewardsDisabledReasons as |reason|}}
          <li>
            {{reason}}
          </>
        {{/each}}
      </>
    {{/if}}
  </>
  <lol-uikit-content-block class="custom-games-error" id="custom-games-champ-select-error" type="dialog-medium">
    <h5 class="preserve-case">
      {{tra.custom_game_champ_select_error_start_game}}
    </>
    <p>
      {{customGameChampSelectErrorBody}}
    </>
    <ul>
      {{#each customGameChampSelectErrorPlayers as |player|}}
        <li>
          {{player}}
        </>
      {{/each}}
    </>
    {{#if showCustomGameMinorRestrictionDetails}}
      <div class="custom-games-minor-restriction-details">
        <p>
          {{tra.custom_game_minor_restriction_details_header}}
        </>
        <ul>
          <li>
            {{tra.custom_game_minor_restriction_details_real_name_auth}}
          </>
          <li>
            {{tra.custom_game_minor_restriction_details_healthy_time}}
          </>
          <li>
            {{tra.custom_game_minor_restriction_details_harmful_behavior}}
          </>
        </>
        <p>
          {{tra.custom_game_minor_restriction_details_footer_text_before_link}}
          <a href="http://lol.qq.com/jksh" target="_blank">
            http://lol.qq.com/jksh
          </>
        </>
      </>
    {{/if}}
  </>
</>
{{matchmaking-errors _isTransitioningState=_isTransitioningState}}
